1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,730
Good morning, how can I help you?

2
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:03,897
Good morning.

3
00:00:03,897 --> 00:00:09,170
Umm, I understand you help fix up students with host families.

4
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,380
That's right...are you interested in...?

5
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:12,900
Yes...

6
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:16,670
Well please sit down and I'll just take a few details.

7
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:17,660
Thank you.

8
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:20,560
Right now.., what name is it?

9
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:21,830
Jenny Chan.

10
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:23,650
Can you spell that please?

11
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:23,700
Yes...

12
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:31,840
J-E-N-N-Y C-H-A-N.

13
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:31,890
Right...

14
00:00:31,890 --> 00:00:34,870
and what is your present address?

15
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:39,200
Sea View Guest House, 14 Hill Road.

16
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:39,250
OK,

17
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:42,650
and do you know the phone number there?

18
00:00:42,650 --> 00:00:42,700
Yes...

19
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:47,886
I have it here, ummm...

20
00:00:47,886 --> 00:00:48,759
2237676,

21
00:00:48,759 --> 00:00:55,740
but I'm only there after about 7 pm.

22
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:58,720
So when would be the best time to catch you?

23
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:03,136
I suppose between 9 and let me see.

24
00:01:03,136 --> 00:01:07,000
half-past, before I leave for the college.

25
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:07,480
Great...

26
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:10,840
and can I ask you your age?

27
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:13,560
I've just had my nineteenth birthday.

28
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:17,250
And how long would you want to stay with the host family?

29
00:01:17,250 --> 00:01:22,527
I'm planning on staying a year but at the moment I'm definitely here for

30
00:01:22,527 --> 00:01:23,658
four months only.

31
00:01:23,658 --> 00:01:27,050
I have to get an extension to my permit.

32
00:01:27,050 --> 00:01:28,718
You're working on it?

33
00:01:28,718 --> 00:01:29,134
Fine...

34
00:01:29,134 --> 00:01:33,720
and what will be your occupation while you're in the UK?

35
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:35,600
Studying English?

36
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:38,710
And what would you say your level of English is?

37
00:01:38,710 --> 00:01:39,232
Umm.

38
00:01:39,232 --> 00:01:46,540
Good, I think I'd like to say 'advanced' but my written work is below

39
00:01:46,540 --> 00:01:49,150
the level of my spoken,

40
00:01:49,150 --> 00:01:51,760
so I suppose it's intermediate.

41
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:54,232
Certainly your spoken English is advanced.

42
00:01:54,232 --> 00:01:54,644
Anyway,

43
00:01:54,644 --> 00:01:57,940
which area do you think you would prefer?

44
00:01:57,940 --> 00:02:04,726
Ummm, well I'm studying right in the centre but I'd really like to live

45
00:02:04,726 --> 00:02:06,180
in the north-west.

46
00:02:06,180 --> 00:02:13,950
That shouldn't be a great problem...we usually have lots of families up there.

47
00:02:13,950 --> 00:02:17,240
And do you have any particular requirements for diet?

48
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:20,326
Well, I'm nearly a vegetarian ...

49
00:02:20,326 --> 00:02:21,560
not quite.

50
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:23,335
Shall I say you are?

51
00:02:23,335 --> 00:02:25,110
It's probably easier that way.

52
00:02:25,110 --> 00:02:26,170
That would be best.

53
00:02:26,170 --> 00:02:28,830
Anything about your actual room?

54
00:02:28,830 --> 00:02:33,545
I would prefer my own facilities-en suite', is that right?

55
00:02:33,545 --> 00:02:40,146
And also if it's possible a TV and I'd also like the house to

56
00:02:40,146 --> 00:02:46,276
have a real garden rather than just a yard, somewhere I could sit

57
00:02:46,276 --> 00:02:47,690
and be peaceful.

58
00:02:47,690 --> 00:02:48,730
Is that all?

59
00:02:48,730 --> 00:02:49,265
Well...

60
00:02:49,265 --> 00:02:56,751
I'm really serious about improving my English so I'd prefer to be the only

61
00:02:56,751 --> 00:02:58,890
guest if that's possible?

62
00:02:58,890 --> 00:03:02,530
No other guests...Yes, you get more practice that way.

63
00:03:02,530 --> 00:03:07,626
Anyway, obviously all this is partly dependent on how much you're willing to pay.

64
00:03:07,626 --> 00:03:09,810
What did you have in mind?

65
00:03:09,810 --> 00:03:14,143
I was thinking in terms of about ￡60-￡80 a week,

66
00:03:14,143 --> 00:03:18,870
but I'd go up to a hundred if it was something special.

67
00:03:18,870 --> 00:03:22,500
Well I don't think we'd have any problems finding something for you.

68
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:23,680
Oh, good.

69
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:25,760
And when would you want it for?

70
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:29,940
I'd like to move in approximately two weeks.

71
00:03:29,940 --> 00:03:36,890
Let me see, it's the 10th today...so if we go for the Monday it's

72
00:03:36,890 --> 00:03:38,280
the 23rd March.

73
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,030
Yes.

74
00:03:39,030 --> 00:03:39,553
Right...

75
00:03:39,553 --> 00:03:40,076
good,

76
00:03:40,076 --> 00:03:44,260
and if I could ask one last question...
